	(text "VDD 4 × 100 nF + 4.7 µF, VDDA 10 nF + 1 µF, VREF+ 100 nF + 1 µF (DS12712 p.77 Fig.15);\nVDDA = VREF+ = +3V3_A (bead from +3V3, sheet 01). PCB: each cap at its own pin.\nR304-R306 1 MΩ: OC_TRIP_N / KILL_N / ISENSE_OUT defined with the B2B unplugged (R3-12).\nISENSE_OUT on PA0 + PB0 by design; C318 1 nF = ADC sampling reservoir (R419 100 R, sheet 04)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 210.82 0)
